                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Do we want to get this from std::chrono?  Something like (untested)\n\nstd::chrono::year_month_day demarcation(\n        2006y, std::chrono::January, 1d\n    );\nstd::chrono::minutes demarcationMinutes = demarcation.count();\n\nNot sure that's any better or worse than what's here.  Close out with noop if you don't feel like making that change, I'm fine either way."
                },
                {
